Not in this repository, but built by bridge/build.sh
----------------------------------------------------

bridge/build.sh downloads and builds the two programs below into
$JOLT_OPENLDK_HOME (by default ~/.cache/jolt-openldk). Neither is copied
into this repository. What build.sh produces in dist/ is a combination of
them and the bridge, and anyone who redistributes that output takes on
their terms.

